      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a similar issue.\n\n      In the Live build my avatar is fine, but for others in the Beta, they all see me as a tiny person floating around where my hips should be. This is especially annoying because they keep looking at my crotch and asking why I'm so small. \n\n      I tried out the beta to see what was happening, and when I loaded in, I was super tiny and couldn't rescale myself to the right height. It was all broken. This is true for a few of my main avatars, so it's a little frustrating that there's nothing that I can do.\n\nIt is fine for other avatars though.",
