      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: This is happening on SDK 3 Avatars. I cannot seem to replicate it on SDK 2 avatars.\n\nI've noticed its happening on avatars that I have rescaled in unity because they were too small originally. This has never been an issue in the past.\n\nThis also appears to be true for only one of my avatars that was scaled down instead of up. With the difference being that I'm locked at a higher height rather than being too small.\n\nThe SDK 2 avatars that I know were too small and had to be rescaled in unity don't seem to have this issue either. It's only the SDK 3 avatars as far as I can tell.\n\nYou can also see in my screenshots that my height is lower than what should be possible by normal means.",
