      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Hi, in the video link below, i have showcased scaling, and the effect it produces right after switching avatar to something else (tries to reflect the current scale during the hologram state)\n\nI haven't encountered this bug with any SDK2.0 avatar yet, this avatar was not scaled in Unity and does not use any 3rd party systems like GoGoLoco. Evertything is set to default.\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/BBXWXh2Pul8",
      "viewerReactions": null,
